title: "ScholarLib-EM: A Curated Collection of Open-Access Papers in Economics & Management"
abstract: "A systematically organized, open-access repository of 45+ research papers across 18 fields in Economics and Management, classified by 6-level taxonomy (Year, Field, Topic, Journal Tier, Method, Industry Scenario) with ready-to-use BibTeX citations for academic writing."
